# Every text file is checked out with LF, Windows included. Biome formats
# with LF and the MDX tests compare LF text, so a CRLF working copy (what
# core.autocrlf=true gives) fails both locally while CI, on Linux, passes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Bundled runtimes are verified byte for byte by scripts/verify-runtimes.sh:
# no line-ending conversion may touch them, on any platform.
apps/web/public/runtimes/** -text
